Subject: [PATCH] W2 update: DOM builder

WEBVIEW_PLAN.md phase W2:
- wv_dom.{h,c}: flat node array (parent/first/last-child/next-sibling
  index links), implicit document root, explicit open-element stack with
  hard depth cap 512 (elements past the cap append without nesting,
  truncated=1)
- implicit closes: p, li, td/th (never the row), tr, 14 void elements
- mismatched closes reconciled pop-until-match; unmatched ends ignored
