- QEMU gate: 10000-deep doc built in-guest on the real 64 KiB stack
  (dom deep test: PASS); dom smoke PASS; test_webview.sh asserts both
- bug caught: <td> was closing its <tr> (cells close cells, rows close
  rows) -- fixed with regression
- make test-unit green
